- `crates/theme/src/settings.rs` (rel=5): Holds ThemeSettings and related enums for UI density, font sizes, theme/icon theme selection (static/dynamic), and system appearance, with global registration and conversion from settings content.
- `crates/theme/src/theme.rs` (rel=5): Central theme system initializer and API that sets up ThemeRegistry, ThemeSettings, font cache, picks configured theme/icon theme, and observes settings to reload themes and font sizes.

