- `crates/workspace/src/pane_group.rs` (rel=5): Represents hierarchical pane groups and axes, supporting splitting, removal, resizing, swapping, rendering, and finding neighboring panes relative to the active pane.
- `crates/workspace/src/workspace.rs` (rel=5): Central workspace orchestrator that manages panes, docks, items, serialization, and global actions for opening, saving, and toggling UI, integrating with projects, worktrees, remote clients, terminals, and debuggers.
- `crates/workspace/src/workspace_settings.rs` (rel=5): Maps persisted settings into a WorkspaceSettings struct and imports select VS Code settings into the app’s SettingsContent, covering panes, docks, autosave, startup behavior, and UI toggles.

